; Import library source for the FRUC redistributable. NVIDIA ships headers with
; proc-name macros and no .lib, so the build generates an import library from this
; file and the entry points resolve through the import table when the process loads.
; That makes NvOFFRUC.dll (beside the exe) a launch requirement for every mode.
LIBRARY NvOFFRUC.dll
EXPORTS
    NvOFFRUCCreate
    NvOFFRUCRegisterResource
    NvOFFRUCUnregisterResource
    NvOFFRUCProcess
    NvOFFRUCDestroy
